  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Microfinance and micro-enterprises in rural communities in northwestern Ecuador - Opening the Doors to the most needy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fundacin para el Desarrollo de Alternativas Comunitarias de Conservacin del Trpico ALTROPICO will work with 10 small, rural community-run businesses in the provinces of Esmeraldas and Carchi to improve income, access to credit, long-term economic planning, and community organizations. Its training, technical assistance and opportunities to participate in exchanges will directly benefit 270 individuals and will indirectly benefit 1,200 family members and other community residents.</narrative>
  </description>
